       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ROTATEARRAYLEFT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ARR.
           05 ARR-ITEM PIC 9(2) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       01 ROTATED-ARR.
           05 ROTATED-ITEM PIC 9(2) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       01 SHIFT-COUNT PIC 9(1) VALUE 2.
       01 START-POS PIC 9(2).
       01 OUT-POS PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
       01 I PIC 9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 10 TO ARR-ITEM(1)
           MOVE 20 TO ARR-ITEM(2)
           MOVE 30 TO ARR-ITEM(3)
           MOVE 40 TO ARR-ITEM(4)
           MOVE 50 TO ARR-ITEM(5)
           MOVE 60 TO ARR-ITEM(6)

           COMPUTE START-POS = SHIFT-COUNT + 1
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM START-POS BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
               MOVE ARR-ITEM(I) TO ROTATED-ITEM(OUT-POS)
               ADD 1 TO OUT-POS
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > SHIFT-COUNT
               MOVE ARR-ITEM(I) TO ROTATED-ITEM(OUT-POS)
               ADD 1 TO OUT-POS
           END-PERFORM

           DISPLAY "ORIGINAL:"
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
               DISPLAY ARR-ITEM(I)
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "ROTATED LEFT BY " SHIFT-COUNT ":"
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
               DISPLAY ROTATED-ITEM(I)
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
